	"nodes":[
		{"id":"37367ddcf9bcb89e","x":-125,"y":-30,"width":605,"height":210,"type":"text","text":"Dawn District:\nThe religious district is located at the bottom of the Sky View district just below the mountains. This is also where Caesar resides in the ginormous chapel called Lights Respite. This area is mostly just residential and is where the most people in the city live. There is also a museum called the History of Villatos which is a library/museum with information on the Gods all past wars and some secret stuff that nobody has access to. \n"},
